  "post": {
    "caption": "Eight guests sit down for Thanksgiving dinner, and every pair greets each other exactly once. How many greetings is that?\n\nGuest 1 greets 7 people, guest 2 greets 6 new people, and so on: 7 + 6 + 5 + 4 + 3 + 2 + 1 = 28.\n\nShortcut: each of the 8 guests greets 7 others, which counts every pair twice, so 8 × 7 ÷ 2 = 28. What would it be with 10 guests?",
